        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 9d10+18 (67 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +7</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 ft. (6 squares), burrow 20 ft.</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 23 (+3 Agy, +10 natural), touch 13, flat-footed 20</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +9/+13</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Sting +13 melee (1d4+4 plus poison)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> Sting +13 melee (1d4+4 plus poison) and 2 claws +11 melee (1d4+2)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 5 ft./5 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> Backstab +2d6, poison (DC 16)</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., low-light vision, poison resistance, scent</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +8, Ref +9, Will +3</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 19, Agy 16, Sta 15, Int 4, Spt 11, Cha 8</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Listen +4, Spot +4, Stealth +14*</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Combat Reflexes, Improved Initiative, Multiattack, Skill Focus</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> The Barrens, Burning Steppes, Durotar, Silithus, Tanaris, Thousand Needles</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Solitary, pair, or nest (3-12)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> 10-16 HD (Medium); 17-24 HD (Large)</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> +3</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
